  "title": "Slow Cooker Pasta Fagioli Soup",
  "description": "This easy crockpot pasta fagioli soup cooks up in a slow cooker with ground beef, kidney beans, and Italian tomatoes for a set-it-and-forget-it meal.",
  "authors": [
